On a Hikvision Smart Board (Interactive Flat Panel), your download location depends 
on whether you are using the built-in Android OS or a Windows OPS (plug-in PC module).
Find your files using these steps for your specific system:

1. Built-In Android OS Default Folder: Navigate to the Apps menu, open the File Manager
(or Explorer), select Internal Storage, and go to the Download folder.

Alternative: Check the pre-installed web browser. Open the browser's settings to verify
or change the default saving path.

2. Windows OPS (Built-in PC Module)Many Hikvision boards are equipped with an OPS 
   computer module running Windows. 

Default Folder: Go to C:\Users\[Username]\Downloads using the standard Windows File 
Explorer. 

Web Browser: If you downloaded files directly from a browser (like Edge or Chrome), 
press Ctrl + J in the browser to view your download history and find the exact file 
location.
